cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use pyptine, please cite it as below. Data obtained with it come from
  Statistics Portugal (INE) and must be cited as INE's: every DataResponse
  carries its citation (DataResponse.citation).
title: "pyptine: a Python client for the API of Statistics Portugal (INE)"
type: software
authors:
